- [ ] Old recordings open in the editor and replay normally (no disabled steps, same results).
- [ ] Pick Element, validate locator and test navigate in the Add / Edit Action dialog.
- [ ] Validation steps (validate text / element, count elements, compare value) pass and fail as before.
